# Local Maestro credentials — copy to .env.maestro (gitignored).
# Smoke accounts were created via Supabase Admin during PH1.
#
# PH2 grammar smoke (`pnpm run e2e:ios:grammar`) also requires:
#   - `feature_grammar` = true in Supabase `app_config` for the smoke user’s project
#   - Grammar content on Supabase (`008` seed: 13 topics × 52 lessons × 936 exercises)
#
# PH3 vocabulary smoke (`pnpm run e2e:ios:vocabulary` / `e2e:android:vocabulary`) also requires:
#   - `feature_vocabulary` = true in Supabase `app_config` (or `VOCABULARY_FORCE_LOCAL_SEED=1` in the app build)
#   - Vocabulary content available (local packs preview and/or `013`/`014` migrations applied)
#
# Optional: MAESTRO_IOS_UDID=<simulator-uuid> when multiple simulators are booted.

